# Repo-root .dockerignore (#97). `apps/local/docker-compose.yml` builds with
# `context: ../..`, and Docker only honours the ignore file at the context
# root — an `apps/local/.dockerignore` is silently unused. Keep this file at
# the root; do not re-add one under apps/local.
.git
.github
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/.tsbuildinfo
**/coverage
**/*.log
# Never ship a local env file into the image (Dockerfile `COPY apps/local`).
**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.example
# Local data / artifacts a developer may have next to the app.
apps/local/data
